{"id":70722,"date":"2026-10-25T19:59:58","date_gmt":"2026-10-25T19:59:58","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70722"},"modified":"2026-10-25T21:02:00","modified_gmt":"2026-10-25T20:02:00","slug":"hyundai-7k","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/hyundai-7k\/","title":{"rendered":"Hyundai 7k 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Hyundai 7k 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Hyundai 7k 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>6 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), com partida marcada para as <strong>09:30<\/strong> no hist\u00f3rico <strong>Est\u00e1dio Nacional do Jamor<\/strong> (Alg\u00e9s) e meta instalada em frente ao <strong>Centro Cultural de Bel\u00e9m<\/strong>, na <strong>Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio<\/strong>, em <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Integrada no programa oficial de s\u00e1bado da <strong>EDP Meia Maratona de Lisboa<\/strong>, esta prova cronometrada de 7.000 metros funciona como um teste r\u00e1pido de estrada na v\u00e9spera da meia maratona.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com limite m\u00e1ximo fixado em <strong>1.000 participantes<\/strong> (idade m\u00ednima de 8 anos) e um tempo limite de <strong>1h30<\/strong> (encerramento \u00e0s 11:00), o tra\u00e7ado de <strong>7 km<\/strong> liga o complexo desportivo do Jamor \u00e0 zona monumental de Bel\u00e9m atrav\u00e9s da Avenida Marginal e da frente ribeirinha do rio Tejo, passando junto ao Mosteiro dos Jer\u00f3nimos e ao Museu da Marinha. A prova disp\u00f5e de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica <em>MyLaps<\/em> no dorsal peitoral, posto de abastecimento oficial aos 5 km e servi\u00e7o gratuito de <em>shuttle<\/em> para os atletas inscritos com sa\u00edda junto ao Museu da Marinha (perto da meta) para o Est\u00e1dio Nacional entre as 08:00 e as 09:00 e regresso das 11:00 \u00e0s 12:00.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong>Maratona Clube de Portugal<\/strong> com o apoio das C\u00e2maras Municipais de Lisboa e de Oeiras, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o atribui trof\u00e9us aos tr\u00eas primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina, al\u00e9m de medalha oficial a todos os finalistas. O levantamento do kit de participa\u00e7\u00e3o (t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, dorsal com chip e saco) decorre exclusivamente na <strong>Sport Expo<\/strong> (Sala Rio do Centro de Congressos de Lisboa, na Junqueira) nos dias 4 e 5 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, das 10:00 \u00e0s 20:00.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u00e0s 09:30<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Partida: Est\u00e1dio Nacional (Jamor, Alg\u00e9s) | Chegada: Centro Cultural de Bel\u00e9m (Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio, Lisboa), Lisboa<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span c